Open Orion — autonomous terminal-based AI agent.

Commands:
  orion            CLI REPL (natural language -> safe shell commands)
  orion --gui      futuristic HUD (same as orion-hud)
  orion-hud        futuristic HUD command deck

Talk mode (voice) is Linux-only and needs pulseaudio/pipewire plus model files.

Configuration and docs: https://github.com/4matthedev/open-orion